# Web Development

## Styling

- TailwindCSS 4.1 with @tailwindcss/vite plugin
- cn() from @repo/ui/lib/utils for conditional classes
- No inline styles
- Design tokens from @repo/ui package

## Forms

- react-hook-form for all forms
- zod (v4 API) for validation schemas - use latest Zod 4 API patterns
- zodResolver for form validation
- Query Context7 for latest Zod 4 API documentation and migration patterns when needed

## Charts

- recharts for data visualization
- Wrap in responsive containers

## Module Federation Config

Shell (apps/web-shell):
- Imports remotes dynamically
- Shares: react, react-dom, react-router-dom, zustand

Remotes (apps/web-auth, etc.):
- Expose pages via remoteEntry.js
- Same shared dependencies as shell

## MFE Rules

- Only Tailwind utility classes
- No global CSS selectors
- No conflicting @layer definitions
- Lazy load remotes with Suspense

